/pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r27"><label>Joris 2006</label><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Joris</surname><given-names>PX</given-names></name>, Van de Sande B, Louage DH, van der Heijden M. Binaural and cochlear disparities. <source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source> <volume>103</volume>: <fpage>12917</fpage>&#x02013;12922, <year>2006</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16908859</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r28"><label>Kuwada 2006</label><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Kuwada</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, Fitzpatrick DC, Batra R, Ostapoff EM. Sensitivity to interaural time differences in the dorsal nucleus of the lateral lemniscus of the unanesthetized rabbit: comparison with other structures. <source>J Neurophysiol</source> <volume>95</volume>: <fpage>1309</fpage>&#x02013;1322, <year>2006</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16338997</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r29"><label>Lehman 2006</label><citation citation-type="other"><name><surname>Lehman</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name> <source>Nonparametrics: Statistical Methods Based on Ranks</source> (rev. ed.). New York: Springer, <year>2006</year>.</citation></ref><ref id="r30"><label>Louage 2006</label><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Louage</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name>, Joris PX, van der Heijden M. Decorrelation sensitivity of auditory nerve and anteroventral cochlear nucleus fibers to broadband and narrowband noise. <source>J Neurosci</source> <volume>26</volume>: <fpage>96</fpage>&#x02013;108, <year>2006</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16399676</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r31"><label>Louage 2004</label><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Louage</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name>, van der Heijden M, Joris PX. Temporal properties of responses to broadband noise in the auditory nerve. <source>J Neurophysiol</source> <volume>91</volume>: <fpage>2051</fpage>&#x02013;2065, <year>2004</yea